# `cargo tauri dev`'s file watcher doesn't read the parent directory's
# .gitignore — without this, build.rs's own `swift build` writes temp lock
# files under apple-bridge/.build/ on every invocation, the watcher sees them
# as a source change, and triggers another rebuild that writes another lock
# file: an infinite rebuild loop (reproduced while testing this app).
apple-bridge/.build
resources/apple-bridge
ollama-runtime
